AlphaEvolve implementation for RSIKit using Slick and Pydantic

This is an independent implementation of the published AlphaEvolve algorithm,
not Google DeepMind's internal agent. No AlphaEvolve agent source is published
in the official accompanying repository.

The island initialization and weaker-half reseeding policy in agent.py adapts
the algorithm in the official FunSearch implementation:
https://github.com/google-deepmind/funsearch/blob/main/implementation/programs_database.py
