Modifications: ordinary Python state and RNG; arbitrary complete source text;
per-cell, per-objective champions; caller-selected target metric; reset by
completed attempts; asyncio workers; injected evaluators; external Slick prompts.

AlphaEvolve's official results and verification code are available at:
https://github.com/google-deepmind/alphaevolve_results
They contain problem-specific results, not reusable agent code, and are not vendored.

RSIKit adaptation: Python Solution classes, Pydantic JSON proposals instead of
paper-format text diffs, syntax/interface checks, and isolated Gymnasium evaluation.
Adapted from the local slick-bits implementation; no runtime dependency on slick-bits.
